": 2002680, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16xa0.jpg"}, {"id": 2002681, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16xa1.jpg"}, {"id": 2002682, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16xa2.jpg"}, {"id": 2002669, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16x9p.jpg"}, {"id": 2002672, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16x9s.jpg"}, {"id": 2002673, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16x9t.jpg"}, {"id": 2002674, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16x9u.jpg"}, {"id": 2002683, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16xa3.jpg"}], "slug": "where-giants-fall", "summary": "Fight through swarms, build an arsenal and bring down towering giants in this 3D top-down fantasy bullet-heaven roguelite. Explore fantasy landscapes that change with each run, collect upgrades and carry your build from one stage to the next.\n\nTurn movement into your advantage. Dash through gaps in the horde, build speed as you run, then launch into a steerable aerial rush. Fly over danger and land with a slam that scatters lesser enemies.\n\nBuild your arsenal and abilities. Choose from 14 weapons, each with 20 levels of upgrades, unlock a manually triggered ultimate at level 10 and build toward a Legendary final upgrade. Combine weapons with passive items, and seek out challenges to earn new active abilities and strengthen the ones you carry: heal, escape danger, control the horde or unleash extra damage when it matters.\n\nStrengthen your build between stages by enhancing weapons at the Giantforge, choose greater danger for greater rewards at the Altars of Peril, and bring down the giants: the Iron Tyrant, Morvessa and Thordir each test your movement, timing and the build you\u2019ve assembled.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/where-giants-fall", "videos": [{"id": 187608, "name": "Trailer", "video_